 "workflow": [
  "Advisor signs in with Entra ID and opens the Advisor desktop on App Service over HTTPS.",
  "The desktop calls the API gateway (API Management) over HTTPS.",
  "The API gateway authenticates and rate-limits the request, then hands it to the Orchestrator agent in Foundry Agent Service.",
  "The orchestrator classifies intent and triggers one or more of four workflows: Client portfolio, Market intel, Asset & trade intel, Advisor helper.",
  "Workflows call GPT-5.6 or Terra/Sol on Azure OpenAI through the AI gateway, which applies token quotas, model routing and fallback.",
  "Workflows read data and take actions through the MCP gateway, which authorizes every tool call to MCP servers on Container Apps (Azure SQL, Cosmos DB, Salesforce, M365, Slack, web search).",
  "Draft responses go to the Compliance agent for policy and suitability checks.",
  "Guardrails (Azure AI Content Safety) screen the response for harmful content and prompt injection.",
  "The approved response returns through the API gateway to the Advisor desktop."
 ]
}